{"id": "EUVD-2026-102977", "enisaUuid": "3a33eb55-5b72-3da1-b9a5-e91feac4f3e4", "description": "IceCMS through 4.1.5 contains an unauthenticated sql injection vulnerability that allows remote attackers to inject SQL through the num path parameter of /WebArticle/findarticlesbynum. Attackers can append crafted SQL after the LIMIT clause concatenated into a MyBatis-Plus QueryWrapper to extract database contents via union-based or blind techniques.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T21:17:27", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/icecms-webresource-webarticle-findbynum-limit-sqli", "https://github.com/Thecosy/IceCMS/blob/afd7a9f0d04a714e7c7e735e566c27f54b5d5201/IceCMS-ment/src/main/java/com/ttice/icewkment/controller/frontend/WebArticleController.java#L169-L175", "https://github.com/Thecosy/IceCMS", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/icecms-through-4.1.5-sql-injection-via-webarticle-findarticlesbynum"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hgc3-v7wx-g8w8", "CVE-2026-111686"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.43, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "fa828beb-b088-3a24-aa68-dc87ee552fde", "product": {"name": "IceCMS", "vendor": {"name": "Thecosy"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22644.1.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e25fedde-9031-3bae-87e4-bc0cfbd3edec", "vendor": {"name": "Thecosy"}}], "isExploited": false}